<footer class="bg-dark text-light py-4 mt-5">
  <div class="container">
    {comment}
      A signup form with no list behind it collects an address and does nothing
      with it -- a broken promise, and a data-protection question rather than a
      rough edge. Off until the Newsletter module is configured; see
      Web\Infrastructure\Settings\PublicWidgetsSettingsContributor.

      The guard is HERE rather than inside the partial because that file is one
      {verbatim} block, where a directive prints as text instead of running.
    {endcomment}
    {if:site.features.newsletter}
      <div class="text-center mb-4">
        {include:`partials/newsletter-signup.html.dtmpl`}
      </div>
    {endif}
    <p class="mb-0 text-muted small text-center">
      &copy; {var:site.label}. Powered by CoolMS2.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
